{"t":"CRWV","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"CoreWeave, Inc.","ko":"코어위브","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":2189,"hq":"Livingston, NJ, United States","website":"https://www.coreweave.com","summary_en":"CoreWeave, Inc. operates as a cloud infrastructure technology company in the United States. The company offers CoreWeave Cloud platform that comprises proprietary software and cloud services that deliver the automation and efficiency needed to manage complex artificial intelligence (AI) infrastructure at scale. It also offers data and storage solutions, such as Local Object Transport Accelerator; infrastructure control solutions, including CoreWeave Kubernetes service; mission control services, including node, rack, and fleet lifecycle management; model and agent development tools comprising Weights & Biases, an AI developer platform; and runtime acceleration. In addition, the company offers graphics processing unit compute, CPU compute, networking services, managed services, and virtual and bare metal servers. Its services also include visual effects rendering, machine learning, pixel streaming, and batch processing. It has a collaboration with AdaniConneX to operate a data center in India. The company was formerly known as Atlantic Crypto Corporation and changed its name to CoreWeave, Inc. in December 2019. CoreWeave, Inc. was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Livingston, New Jersey.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CoreWeave, Inc.는 미국에서 클라우드 인프라 기술 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 복잡한 인공 지능(AI) 인프라를 대규모로 관리하는 데 필요한 자동화와 효율성을 제공하는 독점 소프트웨어와 클라우드 서비스로 구성된 CoreWeave Cloud 플랫폼을 제공합니다. 또한 Local Object Transport Accelerator와 같은 데이터 및 스토리지 솔루션도 제공합니다. CoreWeave Kubernetes 서비스를 포함한 인프라 제어 솔루션; 노드, 랙 및 차량 수명주기 관리를 포함한 임무 제어 서비스; AI 개발자 플랫폼인 Weights & Biases로 구성된 모델 및 에이전트 개발 도구 그리고 런타임 가속. 또한 이 회사는 그래픽 처리 장치 컴퓨팅, CPU 컴퓨팅, 네트워킹 서비스, 관리 서비스, 가상 및 베어메탈 서버를 제공합니다. 또한 해당 서비스에는 시각 효과 렌더링, 기계 학습, 픽셀 스트리밍 및 일괄 처리가 포함됩니다. AdaniConneX와 협력하여 인도에서 데이터 센터를 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Atlantic Crypto Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2019년 12월에 CoreWeave, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. CoreWeave, Inc.는 2017년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지주 리빙스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":43.66,"mcap":24080087040.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-21.740538,"peg":null,"ps":3.172607,"pb":4.7883306,"ev_ebitda":18.515,"div":0.0,"beta":null,"hi52":138.25,"lo52":40.58},"fin":{"rev":7590000128.0,"rev_g":1.125,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.67418,"op":-0.01903,"net":-0.25402,"roe":-0.43596,"fcf":-9088615424.0,"cash":5538999808.0,"debt":51612999680.0,"de":1027.329,"eps":-3.69,"feps":-2.00823},"own":{"short":0.22399999,"inst":0.77607,"insider":0.18621},"analyst":{"n":38,"mean":132.1842,"median":129.0,"high":278.0,"low":39.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.7619,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":7,"buy":25,"hold":7,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":8,"buy":24,"hold":7,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":8,"buy":23,"hold":8,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":21,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":128.0,"priorPriceTarget":159.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":105.0,"priorPriceTarget":120.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":70.0,"priorPriceTarget":99.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":124.0,"priorPriceTarget":153.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Reduce","FromGrade":"Reduce","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":39.0,"priorPriceTarget":39.0},{"GradeDate":"2